1
00:00:04,366 --> 00:00:06,552
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:06,552 --> 00:00:09,232
The Unlicensed Doctor, Mega Ambler

3
00:00:10,332 --> 00:00:13,334
{Jun} Hey guys! Jun again!

4
00:00:13,334 --> 00:00:17,172
{Jun} Let's watch another episode of Metal Cardbot together!

5
00:00:17,172 --> 00:00:19,988
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

6
00:00:19,988 --> 00:00:22,547
Mega Ambler, setup!

7
00:00:23,147 --> 00:00:24,937
{Mega Ambler} My name is Mega Ambler.

8
00:00:24,937 --> 00:00:28,804
{Mega Ambler} I am a doctor who took care of many patients back on planet Machina.

9
00:00:28,804 --> 00:00:31,542
{Jun} It's nice to see you, Mega Ambler!

10
00:00:31,542 --> 00:00:36,662
{Jun} Today, let's see the story of how I met Mega Ambler.

11
00:00:36,662 --> 00:00:39,344
{Jun} Shall we get started?

12
00:00:41,536 --> 00:00:43,342
The black ambulance?

13
00:00:43,342 --> 00:00:46,084
That's right. An ambulance blackened by soot.

14
00:00:46,084 --> 00:00:51,202
The children taken away as its prey will have their souls stolen by the Grim Reaper,

15
00:00:51,202 --> 00:00:53,408
never to be seen again.

16
00:00:53,408 --> 00:00:55,929
Aah!! I'm so scared!

17
00:00:55,929 --> 00:00:58,432
Is that what you wanted to hear? Then you'll need to try a better story!

18
00:00:58,432 --> 00:01:00,783
Y-yeah, we know it's just a myth!

19
00:01:00,783 --> 00:01:02,686
I've heard about it too.

20
00:01:02,686 --> 00:01:08,409
A child was kidnapped by the black ambulance, and by the time he was found...

21
00:01:08,409 --> 00:01:10,236
he had been turned into a mummy!

22
00:01:10,636 --> 00:01:11,484
Aah!

23
00:01:11,484 --> 00:01:12,622
Stop it already, Anna!

24
00:01:12,622 --> 00:01:15,990
{Mega Ambler} So there were rumors about me going around like that...

25
00:01:15,990 --> 00:01:17,753
{Jun} Mega Ambler!

26
00:01:17,753 --> 00:01:20,917
{Jun} What on earth were you trying to do to those kids?

27
00:01:20,917 --> 00:01:24,387
{Mega Ambler} I only took the injured children to bandage them up.

28
00:01:24,387 --> 00:01:25,571
{Jun} Huh? 

29
00:01:25,571 --> 00:01:29,555
{Jun} You wrapped them up way too much!

30
00:01:30,455 --> 00:01:31,640
I'm back!

31
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,921
Hey Jun, what's up?

32
00:01:35,829 --> 00:01:37,267
What's going on?

33
00:01:37,267 --> 00:01:39,223
I'm giving them a health checkup.

34
00:01:39,223 --> 00:01:41,658
{Mega Ambler} Ah, a health checkup...

35
00:01:41,658 --> 00:01:43,493
{Mega Ambler} Is Edo knowledgeable in that field?

36
00:01:43,493 --> 00:01:44,857
{Jun} Mega Ambler!

37
00:01:44,857 --> 00:01:48,021
{Jun} How about you try joining them next time?

38
00:01:48,021 --> 00:01:49,074
{Mega Ambler} No.

39
00:01:49,074 --> 00:01:52,927
{Mega Ambler} If you keep running like those two, your health will decline.

40
00:01:52,927 --> 00:01:56,933
{Jun} Ahaha... I guess things got a little heated.

41
00:01:59,333 --> 00:02:01,672
Blue Cop is in tip-top shape.

42
00:02:01,672 --> 00:02:03,185
I do feel better than ever.

43
00:02:03,185 --> 00:02:06,441
Mega Trucker, you have a worn out damper in your knee.

44
00:02:06,441 --> 00:02:07,816
Wait, what?

45
00:02:07,816 --> 00:02:09,258
How can you tell?

46
00:02:09,258 --> 00:02:13,721
Because, after ten years in this job, I can tell a lot just by the sound of things.

47
00:02:13,721 --> 00:02:16,570
Whaddya mean? I need fixing? No way!

48
00:02:16,570 --> 00:02:20,492
Uncle Edo's the best mechanic around. You can count on him, even if he is a bit of a grump.

49
00:02:20,492 --> 00:02:22,330
Hey, I heard that.

50
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:24,262
Jun...

51
00:02:24,262 --> 00:02:25,822
Now, let me have a look at you.

52
00:02:25,822 --> 00:02:27,476
Look... at me...?

53
00:02:27,476 --> 00:02:29,030
Lie down and stay still.

54
00:02:33,024 --> 00:02:35,526
Hm. No broken bones.

55
00:02:35,526 --> 00:02:36,335
Alright, then.

56
00:02:38,826 --> 00:02:39,910
Examination complete.

57
00:02:40,930 --> 00:02:42,118
Wrapping things up.

58
00:02:43,258 --> 00:02:45,181
What is going on?

59
00:02:45,181 --> 00:02:47,872
Help me, Jun!

60
00:02:47,872 --> 00:02:52,950
I told you to stay still!

61
00:02:52,950 --> 00:02:54,120
Theo! Are you okay?!

62
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,245
{Mega Ambler} Jun...

63
00:02:55,245 --> 00:02:58,269
{Mega Ambler} I don't think there was any need to break down the door like that.

64
00:02:58,269 --> 00:03:02,432
{Jun} I... I was in a hurry to come and save Theo!

65
00:03:02,432 --> 00:03:03,614
{Mega Ambler} Hmm...

66
00:03:03,614 --> 00:03:07,297
{Mega Ambler} As a doctor, I only wanted to sufficiently treat him.

67
00:03:07,297 --> 00:03:10,995
{Jun} It looked more like you were trying to dress him up like a mummy...?

68
00:03:10,995 --> 00:03:12,706
Are there more robots?

69
00:03:12,706 --> 00:03:14,344
Who are you, then?

70
00:03:14,344 --> 00:03:16,030
You don't know each other?

71
00:03:16,030 --> 00:03:18,481
Mega Ambler is a notorious travelling doctor.

72
00:03:18,481 --> 00:03:20,955
He goes around treating people without a license,

73
00:03:20,955 --> 00:03:22,986
and charging them exorbitant fees.

74
00:03:23,386 --> 00:03:25,918
But you can't deny my skills are the real deal!

75
00:03:27,628 --> 00:03:28,537
Blue Cop!

76
00:03:29,492 --> 00:03:32,269
Broke out of your bandages, I see.

77
00:03:32,269 --> 00:03:34,522
It's no use trying to find a weak spot.

78
00:03:34,522 --> 00:03:37,165
I take thorough care of myself. Unlike a certain someone...

79
00:03:37,165 --> 00:03:38,831
I heard that!

80
00:03:38,831 --> 00:03:40,027
Maybe so.

81
00:03:40,027 --> 00:03:43,133
But a weak spot can easily be made!

82
00:03:43,433 --> 00:03:45,368
That's not what a doctor does!

83
00:03:45,368 --> 00:03:46,573
Blue Cop, Burst Shot!

84
00:03:47,173 --> 00:03:48,695
Burst... Shot!

85
00:03:52,694 --> 00:03:53,804
Forceps Shock!

86
00:03:59,452 --> 00:04:01,637
What's wrong? Should I have a look?

87
00:04:03,688 --> 00:04:05,167
That didn't even leave a scratch.

88
00:04:05,438 --> 00:04:06,453
Huh...?

89
00:04:12,226 --> 00:04:13,010
That's not good.

90
00:04:13,010 --> 00:04:15,434
Aah! What's wrong with your arm?!

91
00:04:15,434 --> 00:04:17,636
I'll take care of your other arm too!

92
00:04:17,636 --> 00:04:18,888
Blue Cop, watch out!

93
00:04:22,571 --> 00:04:25,042
{Mega Ambler} I am always serious and reserved.

94
00:04:25,042 --> 00:04:27,613
{Mega Ambler} How could I fall over so ridiculously...?

95
00:04:27,613 --> 00:04:31,441
{Jun} It's because my joint strategy with Blue Cop worked!

96
00:04:31,441 --> 00:04:32,587
{Mega Ambler} Huh?

97
00:04:32,587 --> 00:04:34,761
{Mega Ambler} Blue Cop, I was embarrassed enough already. 

98
00:04:34,761 --> 00:04:36,634
{Mega Ambler} But you swung it without even thinking?

99
00:04:36,634 --> 00:04:41,224
{Jun} Ah... That's not it! It was all part of my plan!

100
00:04:41,224 --> 00:04:42,424
{Mega Ambler} Well.

101
00:04:42,424 --> 00:04:47,425
{Mega Ambler} I'll admit the last attack was definitely well thought out.

102
00:04:47,425 --> 00:04:49,216
I'll make it so you can't move at all!

103
00:04:52,716 --> 00:04:56,147
Now! Megabolt Punch!

104
00:04:56,147 --> 00:04:58,976
Mega...bolt...

105
00:04:58,976 --> 00:05:00,570
Punch!!

106
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,281
{Jun} Well, everyone? 

107
00:05:10,281 --> 00:05:12,551
{Jun} I was able to rescue Theo safely,

108
00:05:12,551 --> 00:05:15,521
{Jun} and I also sealed Mega Ambler!

109
00:05:15,521 --> 00:05:19,811
{Jun} I hope you'll all look forward to the next "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!

